    {
      "version": "0.1.17",
      "releasedAt": "2026-09-28T13:10:45.216Z",
      "releaseNotes": "v0.1.17\n- 新增 Word 导入：将 .docx 转为可恢复的临时 Markdown 草稿，支持标题、列表、表格、链接和图片预览；保存时一并导出图片资源。\n- 修复暗色模式下全选文字时选区过亮、语法高亮不清晰的问题。\n- 补齐常用 VS Code 快捷键，包括移动或复制行、注释、多光标、代码折叠、查找替换和跳转。\n- 新增版本更新说明：升级后首次打开会显示，也可以从帮助菜单或命令面板再次查看。\n- 修复 Windows 构建时更新日志换行符导致的校验失败，统一跨平台发布检查。\n\nEnglish\n- Import .docx documents as recoverable Markdown drafts with headings, lists, tables, links, and image previews. Export images alongside the saved Markdown file.\n- Improved selection contrast and syntax readability in dark mode.\n- Added familiar VS Code shortcuts for line editing, comments, multiple cursors, folding, find and replace, and navigation.\n- Added versioned What's New notes shown once after an update and available from the Help menu or command palette.\n- Fixed release-note validation for Windows line endings across platform builds.",
